## Lore

A Nightbane who has joined one of the militaristic or guerrilla Factions - or
one who was serving in the military at the time of his Becoming. The package
includes basic military skills and some hand to hand ability for the Facade;
the Morphus has natural combat abilities of its own.

It is one of four skill packages for the Nightbane R.C.C. The packages are
guidelines: a Game Master may allow skills outside them for a convincing
reason.
